# Participant identifiers the pre-commit hook blocks.
#
# Copy to identifiers.txt (gitignored) and add real names, one
# case-insensitive regex per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# identifiers.txt is deliberately NOT tracked: committing a list of real
# names to a public repository in order to keep those names out of it
# would be self-defeating.
#
# Examples:
# Firstname
# Surname
# firstname\.surname@
